{"type":"text","timestamp":1794370028191,"sessionID":"ses_e374767baffe1WKNZ2mDzAagKz","part":{"id":"prt_1c8c9c27d0014G5E39QVzhnPP2","messageID":"msg_1c8c99a740011Iom54V4H5P95W","sessionID":"ses_e374767baffe1WKNZ2mDzAagKz","type":"text","text":"Done. Built on the starter project:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`) — Flask + SQLite (`./data/leaderboard.db`, `DATA_DIR` overridable for tests): register/login (PBKDF2 passwords, itsdangerous signed tokens, persistent secret in `./data`), `POST/GET /api/scores` (server-set `achieved_at`, returns `rank` + `personal_best`), `GET /api/leaderboard` (`period=all|week|day` + aliases, `limit`, `player` substring search, tied scores share rank), `GET /api/admin/scores` (paginated) and `POST /api/admin/scores/{id}/toggle`. Admin comes solely from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup; empty/unset disables admin sign-in. Hidden scores are excluded from leaderboard, ranks and best scores.\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/`) — React+TS with Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` (only `src/index.css` imports Tailwind). Auth/register panel, leaderboard with period tabs, medals for top 3, \"you\" highlight, search + refresh, score form showing new rank and \"New personal best!\", recent submissions + best score, admin table with hide/show and pagination.\n\n**Verified** — `tests/test_api.py` (run with `python3 tests/test_api.py`) covers all 56 checks end-to-end via gunicorn: auth, validation, 401/403/404/409 paths, ranking, hidden rules, week/day windows, restart persistence, token survival, admin-disabled mode, and SPA/asset serving — all pass. `tsc --noEmit` clean, `npm run build` works.\n\nOne sandbox note: `pip -c requirements.lock` hash-pinning fails here because the package proxy alters wheel hashes; it works in the real Docker build. I added no Python deps, so the lock is unchanged.","time":{"start":1794370028157,"end":1794370028161}}}
